title: A decision changed later is edited in place, not superseded.
pid: 78245539-1f5e-42a1-9656-e3050c526572
body: |2-
  Nygard and Rust keep old records and add new ones, because their
  documents have no history. A skg note's history is in Git, and two
  notes on one thing split every reader who holds one of them.
